datasets/investor_risk_dataset.csv
datasets/dataset_report.txt

# Trained ML model artifacts
*.pkl
*.joblib
*.h5
*.model

# Model artifacts are local-only, but the contract doc is tracked.
#
# This pattern MUST stay anchored as `models/*`, not `models/`. A pattern
# with no leading or middle slash matches at EVERY directory depth, so a
# bare `models/` also excluded `backend/app/models/` — the entire
# SQLAlchemy ORM layer was silently untracked, and a fresh clone could
# not start the application. `models/*` contains a middle separator and
# is therefore anchored to this directory only.
#
# The negation must also be `models/*` rather than `models/`: git cannot
# re-include a file that sits inside an excluded directory.
models/*
!models/README.md

